       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. That is double the maximum labeled metformin dose of 2,550 mg/day (850 mg three times daily). A dose that high raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nHere are some possible intended orders:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This is 2,550 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **1700 mg/day in total.** For example, 850 mg PO twice daily with meals.\n- **Another dose.** Most patients take 500\u20131000 mg twice daily, or 500 mg three times daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do want 1700 mg three times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
